Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:38.97,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道这菇有没有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we tell if they're poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.29,0:00:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道一种保险的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there's only one sure way I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.99,0:00:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等肖恩回来了问他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask Shane when he gets back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错　回答正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.53,0:00:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.47,0:00:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔　我出去一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝　别走出戴尔的视线　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, I want you to stay where Dale can see you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的　妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是　别走太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too. Don't wander too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,走得太远就听不到喊声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay within shouting distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是看到了什么就大吼　我们很快就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you see anything, holler. I'll come running.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.38,0:01:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白　老妈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等了这么久　得有点补偿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet. That's what you get for keeping me waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽量小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪儿了　-艾米去采蘑菇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you been? - Amy the mushroom queen…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得等她回来才能过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to wait for her to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:03:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有多少时间　-够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much time do we have? - Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来　-好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂　你还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, are you alive in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂喂　-终于出声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? Hello? - There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我一阵好等\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had me wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里　坦克外面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you? Outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.25,0:05:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在能看到我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对　我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息是　你被行尸包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're surrounded by walkers. That's the bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好消息呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有好消息　-听着　不管你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Listen, whoever you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你　我在这里真的很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind telling you I'm a little concerned in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计　你真该从我这看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man. You should see it from over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准会吓瘫掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be having a major freak-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.34,0:05:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好建议给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got any advice for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啊　你得逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'd say make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,“逃出去”　就这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it? "Make a run for it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别一副不敢相信的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My way's not as dumb as it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你从我的角度看过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got eyes on the outside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会看到只有一只行尸还在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one geek still up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.85,0:05:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他都爬到坦克下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the tank but the others have climbed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,啃那顿马肉大餐去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and joined the feeding frenzy where the horse went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听明白吗　-明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With me so far? - So far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦克另一边的街上没那么多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, the street on the other side of the tank is less crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁他们不注意赶紧跑　你还有戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you move now while they're distracted, you stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.22,0:05:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有弹药吗　-都丢在那个口袋里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got ammo? - In that duffel bag I dropped out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有枪　我能拿回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guns. Can I get to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.49,0:06:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管那袋子了　想也别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the bag, okay? It's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你身上有什么武器　-等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you have on you? - Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到把贝雷塔手枪　一个弹匣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a beretta with one clip,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 15发子弹　-省着点用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 15 rounds. - Make 'em count.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳到坦克的右侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump off the right side of the tank,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直沿着那个方向跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep going in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑个大概50码会看到有条小路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an alley up the street, maybe 50 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有在听　时间紧迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been listening? You're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.90,0:07:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂　我是活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点　快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干毛呢　快上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来　爬上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:07:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真犀利啊　伊斯特伍德（美国硬派影星）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice moves there, Clint Eastwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个新治安官骑着马过来清理治安吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You the new sheriff come riding in to clean up the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.51,0:08:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那可不是我的目的　-好吧　随你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It wasn't my intention. - Yeah, whatever. Yeehaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still a dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫瑞克　谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫格伦　不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bright side:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是死了　好歹是摔死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be the fall that kills us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人比较乐天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a glass-half-full kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在巷子里设了路障吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the one that barricaded the alley?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人设的　应该是在行尸占领这里之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody did… I guess when the city got overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,设路障的人肯定没想到会有这么多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did it was thinking not many geeks would get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在坦克里时　你为什么要冒险帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the tank, why'd you stick your neck out for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着一种天真愚蠢的希望吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it foolish, naive hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,换作是我在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if I'm ever that far up shit creek,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也希望有人来救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody might do the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定我会比你更白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm an even bigger dumbass than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了　带回一个人外加四个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back. Got a guest plus four geeks in the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫拉莱斯　撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morales, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.19,0:09:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的　老子真想毙了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch. We ought to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定　安德莉亚　 放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just chill out, Andrea. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托　别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, ease up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.13,0:09:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动　你搞毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ease up? You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这傻逼害死我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dead because of this stupid asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚　我说快他妈把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, I said back the hell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,行　你就开枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.05,0:10:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dead… all of us…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.49,0:10:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜你所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这里找点必需品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we came into the city to scavenge supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么才能找吗　得活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the key to scavenging is? Surviving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道怎么才能活着吗　得低调行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the key to surviving? Sneaking in and out, tiptoeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.07,0:10:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大张旗鼓地开枪　你以为是决战犹马镇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not shooting up the streets like it's the O.K.Corral.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,辟里啪啦的那些行尸大老远都听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every geek for miles around heard you popping off rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直就是给他们敲钟开餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just rang the dinner bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.14,0:10:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the picture now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说　你到底在外面干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell were you doing out there anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想引起直升机的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to flag the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机　靠　太扯淡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helicopter? Man, that's crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的哪来的直升机　-你丫的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ain't no damn helicopter. - You were chasing a hallucination,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 产生幻觉了吧　-我的确看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- imagining things. It happens. - I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:11:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔　呼叫看看　看能联系上其他人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, T-dog, try that C.B. Can you contact the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人　避难所的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others? The refugee center?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.11,0:11:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊　还避难所呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the refugee center.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.09,0:11:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是还指望有美味佳肴等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got biscuits waiting at the oven for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.01,0:11:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有信号　上楼顶试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got no signal. Maybe the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠　是迪克森干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no. Is that Dixon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这疯子在干什么　-快快　快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that maniac doing? - Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂　迪克森　你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dixon, are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说　跟操着家伙的人说话是不是该客气点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Y'all be more polite to a man with a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠　子弹都快没了　你还浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you wasting bullets we ain't even got!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是想多招点行尸才好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're bringing even more of them down on our ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我悠着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, just chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天被墨西哥衰人嚷嚷也好不到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad enough I've got this taco-bender on my ass all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要听你嚷嚷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gonna take orders from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门　伙计　怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so, bro. That'll be the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,“怎么可能”　对我有意见你就说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That'll be the day"? You got something you want to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿　T仔　算了　-不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, T-dog man, just leave it. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 算了　没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? It ain't worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔　你消停了好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Merle, just relax, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们麻烦够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got enough trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想知道我有什么意见　-对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to know the day? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就直说了　吆喝先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you the day, Mr."Yo."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥不想听黑鬼吆喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the day I take orders from a nigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.97,0:12:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狗日的　-莫尔　算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Motherfucker! - Hey, come on, Merle. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.41,0:12:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dixon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠　别打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, cut it out, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.85,0:12:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手　迪克森　住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! Dixon, get off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.15,0:12:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克森　你会打伤他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dixon, you're gonna hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.75,0:12:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔　别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊　求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no, please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊　好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们就来开个小会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have ourselves a little powwow, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.25,0:13:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来决定谁当老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about who's in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投我自己　你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I vote me. Anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,丫们也来搞点民主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Democracy time, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,投票的举手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show of hands, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in favor? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.61,0:13:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊　投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's see 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,都同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以　很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我说了算　没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that means I'm the boss, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁有异议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁有异议　-我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm? Anybody?　- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你他妈的是谁啊　-友好的警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell are you, man?!　- Officer friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着　莫尔　情况变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look here, Merle. Things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.81,0:14:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不搞种族歧视\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no niggers anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不搞白人优越主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}No dumb-as-shit, inbred white-trash fools either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不过是待宰割的人肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only dark meat and white meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有活人和行尸之分\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's us and the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有齐心协力才能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We survive this by pulling together,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别搞分裂　-你去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not apart.　- Screw you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你听话不爱听重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you make a habit of missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗　那你就再死一次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, screw you twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对带着枪的人说话别太嚣张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ought to be polite to a man with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给点常识好不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会开枪的　你是个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't. You're a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I am anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想找回自己的妻儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a man looking for his wife and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,挡我者死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody that gets in the way of that is gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.62,0:14:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给些时间你好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a moment to think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:15:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想尝尝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got some on your nose there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拿我怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrest me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞什么　那是我的私人财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What are you doing? Man, that was my stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我松绑　你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I get loose, you'd better pray…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到吗　你这头猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you hear me, you pig?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听到没有　-听得到你在瞎喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hear me?!　- Yeah, your voice carries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没有　你这恶心的猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me, you filthy pig?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.28,0:15:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是亚特兰大的警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Atlanta P.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你哪儿来的　-大路的另一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you from?　- Up the road a ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自大路另一头的友好警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, officer friendly from up the road a ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你来到大城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome to the big city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊　下面就像时代广场一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, it's like Times Square down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 信号怎么样　-就像迪克森的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's that signal?　- Like Dixon's brain…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.45,0:15:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,残得可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.55,0:15:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续试　-何必呢　他们什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep trying.　- Why? There's nothing they can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.97,0:16:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁用也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.09,0:16:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,首要任务是离开这个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got some people outside the city is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有什么避难所　别作梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no refugee center. That's a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的对　我们得靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she's right. We're on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.71,0:16:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要自己找出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to us to find a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知　市里这块不太安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}These streets ain't safe in this part of town from what I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧　甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that right, sugar tizz?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, honeybunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.99,0:16:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我解开手铐行不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say you get me out of these cuffs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.79,0:16:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找个地方然后大干一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go off somewhere and bump some uglies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.99,0:16:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反正都要死了　-还不如让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gonna die anyway.　- I'd rather.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧　我懂了　原来你是硬骨头啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rod Muncher. I figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.37,0:16:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走大街出去不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The streets ain't safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.44,0:16:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我们都同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there's an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,大街底下呢　走下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about under the streets? The sewers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦　看看那小巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Glenn, check the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有没有井盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see any manhole covers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有　一定在满是行尸的大街上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, must be all out on the street where the geeks are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.86,0:16:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一定　像这样的二十世纪的老建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not. Old building like this built in the '20s…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大型建筑物在负二层都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big structures often had drainage tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,防洪用的通往下水道的排水管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the sewers in case of flooding down in the subbasements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道　-这是我的工作　曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know that?　- It's my job… was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在城市规划办公室工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked in the city zoning office.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.19,0:17:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这里吗　你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前把这里上下搜了个遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really scoped this place out the other times I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是这栋楼里唯一通往底下的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing in the building that goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从没下去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've never gone down it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会想下去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd want to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟在你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行　至少你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么　觉得我不敢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not me? Think I can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,想说什么就说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止　我总是独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, until now I always came here by myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,进进出出　拿些东西　都不是问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}In and out, grab a few things… no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次带上一队人马　就整个乱套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time I bring a group… everything goes to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无冒犯之意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们要我从这洞里下去　没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want me to go down this gnarly hole, fine…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.87,0:18:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但得由我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only if we do it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面很狭窄\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tight down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我遇到了什么　能尽快逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I run into something and have to get out quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想你们跟在后面堵路　害我被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you all jammed up behind me getting me killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只带一个人　你也不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take one person… not you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有莫尔的枪　我也见识过你的枪法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got Merle's gun and I've seen you shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得在里面把守店门　保护大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd feel better if you were out in that store.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我会更放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching those doors, covering our ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你还有把枪　所以你该和他一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've got the only other gun, so you should go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做我策应　杰奎就待这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You be my wingman. Jacqui stays here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一有情况就冲下面喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happens, yell down to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上把我们弄上来　-好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- get us back up here in a hurry. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好　大家各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, everybody knows their jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉　我拿枪指着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for the gun in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.80,0:19:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,人害怕时难免会冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}People do things when they're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不　那太不应该了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that was entirely unjustified.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:19:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你的确陷我们于绝境\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did get us into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我帮大家逃出去可以弥补吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I get us out, would that make up for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,弥补不了　不过算是个好开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but it'd be a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后得先打开保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time though, take the safety off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则开不了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't shoot otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个礼物　怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gift. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小红点说明保险打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little red dot means it's ready to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你要用到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have occasion to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢提醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂　有人收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Anybody read?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望听到别人的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping to hear somebody's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只有自己的声音太郁闷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm getting sick and tired of hearing mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对　不过是我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, that makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛不扔了那破无线电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you knock that crap off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我头疼　小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're giving me a headache, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不把脑袋坐到屁股底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you pull your head out of your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.94,0:21:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的头就不疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe your headache will go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的　还是想点好事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try some positivity for a change. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我把手铐解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get me out of these cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定给你好好当靠山\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll be all "Sammy sunshine" positive for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那边工具箱里的钢锯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, see that hacksaw over there in that toolbag?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拿过来怎么样　肯定有你好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it for me, hmm? Make it worth your while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.90,0:21:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样伙计　快点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, man? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我弄掉这铐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.57,0:21:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后接着揍我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can beat my ass again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不就是多叫我几声“黑鬼”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or call me nigger some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.97,0:21:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么啊　又不是针对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on now. It wasn't personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是咱俩意见有点不合罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that your kind and my kind ain't meant to mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是说咱俩就不能合作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It don't mean we can't… work together,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.75,0:21:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好谈谈　只要我们大家能双赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}parley, as long as there's some kind of mutual gain involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么　钢锯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… about that hacksaw…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你还想让我帮你拿那支步枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you want me to get that rifle over there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:22:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后等那警察上来时一枪毙了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can shoot that cop when he comes back up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们是到污水管道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we've got ourselves a sewer tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.79,0:22:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰奎说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacqui was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能切开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we cut through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.39,0:22:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,能啊　只要给我个喷灯再来半天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we had a blowtorch and half a day, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔的钢锯肯定没戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale's hacksaw sure as hell won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See something you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我　不过有个人肯定喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me, but I know someone who would.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.29,0:23:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.43,0:23:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在有些方面她还像个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still such a kid in some ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.93,0:23:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽啊　龙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicorns, dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.34,0:23:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就痴迷那类东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's into all that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.70,0:23:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到美人鱼　她最喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mermaids, they rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.03,0:23:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢美人鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loves mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走不就得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.61,0:23:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可有个警察正盯着我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a cop staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算行窃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it be considered looting?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为那些规矩都作废了　你看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think those rules apply anymore. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.96,0:23:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在下面发现什么了　-出不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you find down there? - Not a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.54,0:23:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find a way…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.73,0:23:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.72,0:24:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧工地那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}That construction site,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡车司机总是把钥匙放在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}those trucks, they always keep keys on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.47,0:24:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没办法穿过那片行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never make it past the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.39,0:24:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你帮我从坦克里逃了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me out of that tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.79,0:24:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是　可他们当时在吃东西　都魂不守舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they were feeding. They were distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.33,0:24:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能再让它们分神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we distract them again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.86,0:24:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是　听他的　他什么不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Listen to him. He's onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.23,0:24:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还“声东击西”呢　从电影里学的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A diversion, like on "Hogan's heroes."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.74,0:24:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托　你能消停一下吗　-他们是听声辨物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. Give it a rest. - They're drawn by sound, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.25,0:24:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对　就像狗　听到动静就跑来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, like dogs. They hear a sound, they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.01,0:24:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有呢　-除了能听到你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What else? - Aside from they hear you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.91,0:24:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用嗅觉辨认　一旦抓到就立刻吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see you, smell you and if they catch you, they eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.33,0:24:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会分辨我们的气味　-你闻不出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They can tell us by smell? - Can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们身上有腐尸味　我们没有　多明显的区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}They smell dead, we don't. It's pretty distinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.94,0:24:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果坏主意也有奥运会的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If bad ideas were an Olympic event,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.41,0:24:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个绝对是金牌得主　-他说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This would take the gold. - He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.28,0:24:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停手　慢慢来考虑清楚　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop, okay? Take some time to think this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多慢　他们已经穿过第一道门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time? They already got through one set of doors,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.02,0:24:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玻璃也撑不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}That glass won't hold forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.78,0:25:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩·邓拉普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne Dunlap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.38,0:25:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐治亚州人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgia license.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.58,0:25:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,1979年出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born in 1979.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.09,0:26:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去世时身上有28美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had $28 in his pocket when he died…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.33,0:26:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个女生的照片　她很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a picture of a pretty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.73,0:26:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,“爱你的蕾切尔赠”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"With love, from Rachel."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.10,0:26:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾像我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to be like us…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为账单和房租发愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}worrying about bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者超级杯橄榄球联赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the rent or the Super Bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.00,0:26:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能与家人团聚　一定向他们说起韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I ever find my family, I'm gonna tell them about Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.71,0:26:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.21,0:26:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾是名器官捐赠者\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was an organ donor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.12,0:26:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madre de dios!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.46,0:26:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.99,0:26:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.00,0:27:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dios!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.03,0:27:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.12,0:27:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续砍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep chopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.45,0:27:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快吐了我　-等会再吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am so gonna hurl. - Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家手套都戴好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody got gloves?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.93,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别弄到皮肤上或眼睛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get any on your skin or in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.07,0:28:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.07,0:28:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐　太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh jeez. Oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.14,0:28:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟的不能再糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.75,0:28:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about something else…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.25,0:28:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狗小猫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}puppies and kittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.85,0:28:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,死狗死猫还差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead puppies and kittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.39,0:28:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不厚道了　你怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is just evil. What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.80,0:28:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一次让那疯子好好修理修理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time let the cracker beat his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.99,0:28:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起了　-你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, yo. - You suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.47,0:28:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟他们味道一样了吗　-能不一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we smell like them? - Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.80,0:28:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.67,0:28:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.92,0:29:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们回得来　你们要准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we make it back, be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.63,0:29:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那莫尔·迪克森怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Merle Dixon?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.73,0:29:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把斧子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the axe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.10,0:29:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得多弄点内脏　-天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need… we need more guts. - Oh god!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.86,0:31:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's happening, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.36,0:31:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔　试试那个民用电台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, T-dog, try that C.B.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.66,0:31:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托　你们倒是跟我说句话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. Talk to me, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.46,0:31:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫大本营　我是T仔　有人收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base camp, this is T-dog. Anybody hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.53,0:31:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人能收到我的信息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anybody out there hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.51,0:31:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.64,0:31:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混蛋带着手铐钥匙走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That asshole is out on the street with the handcuff keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.53,0:31:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计　软管不够长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, that hose isn't long for this world, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.33,0:31:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不够　先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.86,0:31:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底哪里能他妈的给换一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we gonna find a replacement?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天色很晚了　他们应该回来了才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's late. They should've been back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.20,0:31:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worrying won't make it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.98,0:32:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好　就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attaboy. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.55,0:32:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,三二一　拉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And three, two, one… pull it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.02,0:32:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.49,0:32:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做“P”字　绕着手指来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your "P" the other way… around your finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.41,0:32:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好　像缠在手指上一样绑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, just tie it like around your finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.33,0:32:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.96,0:32:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫大本营\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, base camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.50,0:32:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人能收到信息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anybody out there hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.64,0:32:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大本营　我是T仔　有人收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base camp, this is T-dog. Anybody hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.42,0:32:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂　你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.58,0:32:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边信号不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reception's bad on this end.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.35,0:32:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请重复　请重复　-肖恩　是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Repeat. Repeat. - Shane, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.55,0:32:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that them?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.71,0:32:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in some deep shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.80,0:32:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困在百货公司里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped in the department store.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.71,0:32:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说他们被困住了　-这到处都是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He say they're trapped? - There are geeks all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.99,0:32:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有成百上千个　我们被包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds of 'em. We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.69,0:32:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔　请重复最后一句　重复下\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-dog, repeat that last. Repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.75,0:33:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚说的是百货商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said the department store.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.05,0:33:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.72,0:33:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肖恩　-不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shane? - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.31,0:33:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not go after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让剩下的成员冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not risk the rest of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.95,0:33:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们也知道　-就这么撒手不管了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Y'all know that. - So we're just gonna leave her there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.05,0:33:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米　我知道这很难接受…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Amy, I know that this is not easy…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.92,0:33:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}She volunteered to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.12,0:33:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自告奋勇前往城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.82,0:33:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错　但她知道其中的风险吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, and she knew the risks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.03,0:33:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是她被困住　那么就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, if she's trapped, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.61,0:33:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得接受事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just have to deal with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.54,0:33:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我亲姐姐　你个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my sister, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.05,0:33:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.67,0:34:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事　别担心　小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's all right, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.63,0:34:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然行得通　真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna work. I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.59,0:35:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话　继续装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't draw attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.87,0:35:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.93,0:35:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是场暴雨而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a cloudburst.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.26,0:35:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里常会下暴雨　很快就会停\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get them all the time. It'll pass real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.22,0:36:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸味是不是被雨水冲掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smell's washing off, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.92,0:36:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是不是被冲掉了　-没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it washing off? - No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.58,0:36:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.34,0:36:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.66,0:36:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.55,0:37:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.43,0:37:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快　快开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go go go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.93,0:38:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要丢下我们　-什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're leaving us. - What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.36,0:38:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要去哪　-不不　给我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where they going? Where they going? - No no, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.64,0:38:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪天哪　他们全聚集在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god. Oh my god. They're all over that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.64,0:38:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得设法把他们引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.01,0:38:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个商店的前卷帘门那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those roll-up doors at the front of the store…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.94,0:38:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮我把他们从那里引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That area? …That's what I need cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.61,0:38:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知他们　让他们到卷帘门口等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise your friends. Tell them to get down there and be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.61,0:38:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么引开这些怪物　我刚没注意听\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm drawing the geeks away how? I… I missed that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.38,0:38:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造噪音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.83,0:39:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,到商店的前卷帘门那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those roll-up doors at the front of the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.09,0:39:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就街对面的卷帘门　在那儿会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}facing the street… meet us there and be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.47,0:39:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快　咱们走　快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.87,0:39:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等　你们不能丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you can't leave me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.93,0:39:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不蠢　兄弟　莫拉莱斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fooling, man! Morales!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.11,0:39:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哥们　别丢下我　-快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, man! Don't do this! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.74,0:39:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的枪　你不能丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's my gun. You can't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.65,0:39:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不要丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me here, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.55,0:39:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫拉莱斯　快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morales, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.88,0:39:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了　我们真得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming! We've gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.82,0:39:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫拉莱斯　你把手铐给我解开　哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morales! You can't leave me like this, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.42,0:39:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔　哥们　你不能丢下我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, T-dog. No, man. You can't leave me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.32,0:39:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能丢下我　至少把手铐解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave me here… not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.99,0:39:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会遭天谴的　你还有没有人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't, man. It's not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.79,0:39:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了　不要丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.33,0:39:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了　T仔　行行好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, T. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.36,0:39:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来　就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.56,0:39:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来　对　快点过来　好哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Co… that's it! Yes! Come on, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.20,0:39:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.41,0:40:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个狗杂种　你他妈故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch! You did that on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.12,0:40:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.84,0:40:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗死人呢你　你他妈就是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lie! You did it on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.35,0:40:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的是意外　-别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was an accident! - Don't leave me, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.66,0:40:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别丢下我　不要丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me! Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.14,0:40:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.76,0:40:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你个骗子　-对不起了　兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You liar! - I'm sorry. Man, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.06,0:40:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起　-别丢下我　别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry.　- Don't leave me! don't do it, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.51,0:40:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你们全家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.74,0:40:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟　别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.71,0:40:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别丢…　别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave… don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.34,0:40:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别锁门　你还是不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What are you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.45,0:40:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会遭报应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna rot in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.45,0:40:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,下地狱吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna rot in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.08,0:40:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我回来　-等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come back, man! - Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.72,0:40:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了　别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I come! Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.32,0:40:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.91,0:40:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.40,0:41:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.55,0:41:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吧　来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.89,0:41:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近点　靠近点　来吧来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get closer. Get closer. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.46,0:41:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.57,0:42:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进来了　快走　他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here! Let's go! They're in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.34,0:42:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走　-快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.51,0:42:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赶紧走　-快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've gotta go! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.09,0:42:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.81,0:42:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.46,0:42:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会下地狱的　去死吧　他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll die! Go to hell! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.72,0:42:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会下第十八层地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna rot in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.50,0:43:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然把钥匙掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped the damn key.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.19,0:43:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Glenn?
